// Boarding action — single-target damage + treasure transfer.
//
// AbilityId 1 (alphabetical: Board < Cannons). Dispatched by
// AttemptBoard physics rule when ships are within `board_range`.
//
// Two effect verbs in one program:
//   * damage 1                — kind=26 EffectDamageApplied
//   * transfer_gold 5         — kind=31 EffectGoldTransfer
//                               (boarder pays 5 gold to the boarded
//                                ship — see ApplyTreasureTransfer)
//
// The .sim's AttemptBoard rule ALSO emits a custom Boarded event in the
// same body so the AttemptOwnershipFlip consumer (which calls the
// not-yet-allowlisted `agents.set_creature_type`) gets a chance to fire.

ability Board {
    target: enemy
    range: 1.5
    cooldown: 6
    hint: damage

    damage 1.0 [PHYSICAL: 100]
    transfer_gold 5
}
